    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SOUTHWEST AIRLINES™\nOctober 25, 1992 Flight Schedule\nMy first concern as a Flight\nAttendant is your comfort\nand safety. It's also my second,\nthird and fourth concern.",
      "Reno/Tahoe\nSacramento\nOakland\nSan Francisco\nas vegas\nBurbank\nLos Angeles\n(LAX)\nSan Diego\nPhoenix\nMountain\nAlbuquerque\nEl Paso\nCente\nEastern\nChicago\n(Midway)\nDetroit\n(City \u0026 Metro)\nCleveland\nColumbus\nIndianapolis\nNashville\nAmarilo Oklahoma City\nLubbock\nMidland/\nOdessa\nAustin,\nSan Antonio\nCorpus\nChristi\nKansas City\nSt. Louis\nTulsa\nLittle Rock\nDallas\n(Love Field)\nHouston\n(Hobby \u0026\nIntercontinental)\nRio Grande Valley\n(Harlingen/South Padre Island)\nBirmingham\nNew Orleans\nIf you fly frequently on Southwest Airlines,\nplease send us your name and address and we will\nplace you on our mailing list. Mail requests to:\nSouthwest Airlines Schedule List, P.O. BoX 650331,\nDallas, TX 75265-0331.\nAll other correspondence should be sent to:\nSouthwest Airlines Co.,\nP.O. BOX 36611, Dallas, TX\n75235-1611.\nSOUTHWEST AIRLINES™™\nJust Plane Smarts™"
    ],
